  "releaseNotes": "Added missing Azure mail cloud event; This probably will happen again after more usage of the feature needing to register more events; Switched some properties from internal to public still private set; Split Log parameters for partial customization; AdvancedSql incorretly creating brackets for non-3 letter schemas fix; Renaming/replacing lots of properties in Options to have it more consistent; Giving more inherited freedom of having full Options settings but making it possible with the Preferences.Context to overwrite them for a specific execution; Added root code snippets in XML documentation from the entry point of Options to ISettings",
